         "text": "The segment $\\left[\\frac{24}{27}, 1\\right]$ has its middle third $\\left(\\frac{25}{27}, \\frac{26}{27}\\right)$ removed, leaving $\\left[\\frac{24}{27}, \\frac{25}{27}\\right]$ on the left."
